@startuml reporting-sequence-diagram
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title REPORTING SERVICE - ĐỒNG BỘ GIAO DỊCH VÀ XUẤT BÁO CÁO EXCEL

actor "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "TransactionSyncController" as SyncCtrl
participant "TransactionService" as TxnSvc
participant "TransactionSyncValidator" as Validator
participant "TransactionRepository" as TxnRepo
database "scentstation_reporting" as DB
actor "Brand Admin" as Admin
participant "ExcelExportController" as ExportCtrl
participant "ExcelExportService" as ExportSvc

== PHẦN 1: ĐỒNG BỘ DỮ LIỆU GIAO DỊCH TỪ ORDER SERVICE ==
OrderSvc -> SyncCtrl: POST /api/reporting/internal/transactions/sync\n{reference: "PAY-XYZ", orderId: "9001", amount: 50000, currency: "VND", status: "PAID", paidAt: NOW()}\n(Header: X-Internal-Api-Key: <Secret>)
activate SyncCtrl

SyncCtrl -> SyncCtrl: apiKeyVerifier.verify(key)
SyncCtrl -> TxnSvc: syncTransaction(request)
activate TxnSvc

TxnSvc -> Validator: validate(request)
activate Validator
Validator --> TxnSvc: OK (Dữ liệu hợp lệ)
deactivate Validator

TxnSvc -> TxnRepo: findByReference("PAY-XYZ")
activate TxnRepo
TxnRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM transactions WHERE reference = 'PAY-XYZ'
activate DB
DB --> TxnRepo: Optional.empty (Giao dịch mới)
deactivate DB
TxnRepo --> TxnSvc: null
deactivate TxnRepo

TxnSvc -> TxnRepo: save(Transaction Entity)
activate TxnRepo
TxnRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO transactions (reference, order_id, amount, currency, status, paid_at, ...)
deactivate TxnRepo

TxnSvc --> SyncCtrl: TransactionResponse {reference: "PAY-XYZ", status: "PAID"}
deactivate TxnSvc
SyncCtrl --> OrderSvc: 200 OK (TransactionResponse)
deactivate SyncCtrl

== PHẦN 2: BRAND ADMIN TRUY VẤN VÀ XUẤT FILE BÁO CÁO EXCEL ==
Admin -> ExportCtrl: GET /api/reporting/excel/export?from=2026-11-01T00:00:00&to=2026-11-14T23:59:59
activate ExportCtrl

ExportCtrl -> ExportSvc: exportToExcel(from, to)
activate ExportSvc

ExportSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM transactions WHERE paid_at BETWEEN ... AND status = 'PAID'
activate DB
DB --> ExportSvc: List<Transaction>
deactivate DB

ExportSvc -> ExportSvc: Khởi tạo Apache POI Workbook:\n1. Ghi Sheet "Transactions Report"\n2. Định dạng cột tiền tệ VND & ngày giờ\n3. Tính tổng doanh thu và số đơn thành công\n4. Đóng gói mảng byte[] (.xlsx)

ExportSvc --> ExportCtrl: byte[] Excel Stream
deactivate ExportSvc
ExportCtrl --> Admin: 200 OK (Tải về file Excel đính kèm)
deactivate ExportCtrl

@enduml
